                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The soup and garlic bread were delicious and worth ordering as part of the set meal. The pesto-baked clam risotto and kimchi pork squid noodles were also good; the seasoning was light and not too greasy. However, since they were baked, they had to be eaten while hot. Next time I\u0027d like to try other flavors. The seafood was very fresh.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "濃湯跟大蒜麵包很好吃，值得加套餐來點\n青醬焗烤蛤蠣燉飯與泡菜豬筆管麵。不得不誇獎，調味偏清淡吃起來不太膩口。但因還是焗烤的關係還是要趁熱吃完。下次會想點別的口味是看看。海鮮很新鮮。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
