                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The Thai-style spicy and sour flavor, even with just a touch of spice, is really satisfying 😋. You can choose between penne or regular thin noodles.\n\nThe counter offers a variety of condiments, including cheese powder, Tabasco sauce, and black pepper.\n\nDuring lunch hours, it\u0027s recommended to arrive early to secure a table.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "泰式酸辣小辣就很有感😋\n麵條可選筆管麵或一般細麵。\n櫃台有起司粉、Tabasco 、黑胡椒等多種調味料。\n中午餐期建議提早卡位",
